WEBVTT

01:28.025 --> 01:29.025
LOVE & CROWN

01:29.105 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL "MY QUEEN"
BY XIE LOUNAN

01:31.105 --> 01:33.785
EPISODE 1

01:34.945 --> 01:36.025
Grand Tutor Ling,

01:36.825 --> 01:38.785
when will you let me rule in my own right?

01:38.865 --> 01:41.105
The day Cangcang weds you

01:41.185 --> 01:43.945
will be the day you take real power.

01:59.145 --> 02:00.345
You asked me here

02:00.905 --> 02:02.305
because of your master?

02:02.985 --> 02:04.065
You knew, yet you still dared to come?

02:05.585 --> 02:07.105
I killed him

02:07.185 --> 02:08.345
for a reason.

02:08.425 --> 02:09.584
A reason?

02:13.745 --> 02:14.585
Yes.

02:15.465 --> 02:17.305
One I cannot tell you.

02:18.385 --> 02:19.665
Then I won't ask.

02:21.545 --> 02:22.425
I only want the outcome.

02:36.585 --> 02:39.385
XIAO HUAN, EMPEROR OF GREAT QI

02:39.465 --> 02:42.225
LING CANGCANG, GRAND TUTOR'S DAUGHTER

02:46.865 --> 02:47.905
What are you waiting for?

02:49.625 --> 02:51.505
Didn't you say you wanted to kill me?

02:51.585 --> 02:53.705
I will give you the chance.

02:56.585 --> 02:57.465
Do it.

03:32.025 --> 03:32.945
Ling Cangcang,

03:34.345 --> 03:35.985
you're too soft after all.

04:00.705 --> 04:02.945
Better prepare for our wedding.

04:06.265 --> 04:07.505
You killed my master.

04:08.545 --> 04:09.745
How could I ever marry you?

04:34.025 --> 04:35.105
You will,

04:36.345 --> 04:37.905
because you have no choice.

04:39.185 --> 04:40.265
In two months,

04:43.305 --> 04:45.465
I will make you my empress.

04:58.225 --> 04:59.185
Hongqing,

05:00.545 --> 05:02.305
escort the future
empress back to the Ling Manor.

05:02.385 --> 05:03.265
Yes, Your Majesty.

05:20.785 --> 05:23.265
LING MANOR

05:32.625 --> 05:35.305
LING XUEFENG, GRAND TUTOR OF GREAT QI

05:36.665 --> 05:37.825
Father.

05:45.665 --> 05:46.665
I will never marry him.

05:48.345 --> 05:49.225
My Lady,

05:49.305 --> 05:51.145
whatever you decide,
you should talk it out with Father.

05:56.105 --> 05:57.305
Cangcang,

06:01.225 --> 06:02.705
it is

06:04.545 --> 06:06.145
an imperial decree.

06:07.265 --> 06:08.385
To defy it is a crime

06:08.465 --> 06:10.265
punishable by
the extermination of the whole clan.

06:11.465 --> 06:12.465
Father,

06:13.665 --> 06:15.625
you helped him to the throne,

06:15.705 --> 06:17.505
and this is how he repays you?

06:17.585 --> 06:18.785
Mind your tongue.

06:22.305 --> 06:23.225
Father.

06:26.145 --> 06:29.385
He is now the Emperor.

06:31.145 --> 06:32.625
"When a ruler commands death,

06:34.425 --> 06:36.105
a subject must obey."

06:36.185 --> 06:37.265
So an emperor

06:38.025 --> 06:40.625
may kill at will and trample human life?

06:41.225 --> 06:43.385
His Majesty is the ruler of Great Qi.

06:44.545 --> 06:47.105
What he does and whom he kills

06:47.185 --> 06:48.545
is not for others to judge.

06:48.625 --> 06:50.745
But he killed my master!

07:04.825 --> 07:07.105
Father, I'd rather die than marry him!

07:20.865 --> 07:22.065
There were reasons

07:22.985 --> 07:24.825
your Master Li Lu had to die.

07:32.905 --> 07:33.945
Luo.

07:34.025 --> 07:36.145
LUO XIANXUE, GRAND TUTOR'S ADOPTED SON

07:39.065 --> 07:39.905
Here.

07:40.505 --> 07:41.505
It's snowing hard.

07:41.585 --> 07:42.585
Don't catch cold.

07:46.905 --> 07:47.745
Let's go.

08:09.625 --> 08:10.665
Cangcang!

08:11.345 --> 08:12.505
Come on.

08:40.345 --> 08:41.505
If you wish to die,

08:42.585 --> 08:44.105
I can oblige.

08:51.705 --> 08:52.985
Mind your manners!

08:55.665 --> 08:56.585
Stand down!

08:58.825 --> 09:00.425
Your Majesty, I am guilty.

09:01.225 --> 09:02.065
What guilt?

09:03.465 --> 09:04.545
You are my teacher.

09:04.625 --> 09:06.105
You once fought alongside my father.

09:06.185 --> 09:08.065
As I said before, outside the court,

09:08.745 --> 09:10.865
you need not kneel to me.

09:11.745 --> 09:13.865
I failed to discipline my child.

09:13.945 --> 09:16.105
Please forgive me!

09:17.065 --> 09:19.705
Traitors courting death

09:20.785 --> 09:22.505
have nothing to do with you.

09:22.585 --> 09:23.705
Xiao Huan!

09:26.385 --> 09:27.945
There's no love between us.

09:28.025 --> 09:29.185
Why can't you let me go?

09:30.945 --> 09:32.345
We are bound by fate.

09:32.905 --> 09:35.265
I will never let you go.

09:38.625 --> 09:39.465
Let's go.

09:50.545 --> 09:52.705
What an intrepid warrior,
repaying kindness with betrayal.

09:53.305 --> 09:54.865
I forced him to take me.

09:54.945 --> 09:55.825
Come at me.

09:56.425 --> 09:57.465
Luo Xianxue,

09:58.065 --> 10:00.345
I warned you back in Southern Chu.

10:01.425 --> 10:02.985
Did you really think you could escape?

10:04.145 --> 10:05.905
Father, forgive me.

10:16.025 --> 10:17.225
Dying by my sword

10:18.065 --> 10:19.905
-is no injustice to you.
-Xiao Huan!

10:20.625 --> 10:21.665
Let him go,

10:22.985 --> 10:23.825
or I'll take my life right here.

10:33.945 --> 10:34.985
If you dare take your own life,

10:35.985 --> 10:38.345
the entire Ling clan
will follow you to the grave.

10:46.265 --> 10:47.465
Your Majesty…

11:08.385 --> 11:09.225
Father…

11:09.825 --> 11:10.745
Your Majesty, I am guilty.

11:11.945 --> 11:12.825
I beg

11:13.665 --> 11:15.265
to resign my post.

11:15.825 --> 11:17.825
Please, Your Majesty,

11:17.905 --> 11:20.705
show mercy and spare

11:23.025 --> 11:24.825
my only daughter.

11:36.505 --> 11:37.425
Father…

11:48.745 --> 11:49.705
Xiao Huan,

11:50.945 --> 11:52.025
what do you want from me?

11:53.705 --> 11:54.705
I want you

11:56.225 --> 11:57.505
to marry me of your own free will.

12:00.385 --> 12:01.865
Then spare the Ling clan

12:02.625 --> 12:03.665
and spare Luo Xianxue!

12:05.665 --> 12:07.305
Is this how you beg?

12:22.825 --> 12:23.705
I, Ling Cangcang,

12:24.985 --> 12:25.825
humbly beg Your Majesty

12:26.505 --> 12:27.785
to spare the Ling clan

12:29.065 --> 12:30.105
and spare Luo Xianxue.

12:32.185 --> 12:33.025
I will return home with my father

12:35.905 --> 12:36.905
and marry you

12:38.105 --> 12:39.345
in two months.

12:40.785 --> 12:41.665
Oh?

12:43.025 --> 12:45.265
You make it sound as if I forced you.

12:54.345 --> 12:55.465
I, Ling Cangcang,

12:59.305 --> 13:00.305
wish

13:01.225 --> 13:02.465
to marry Your Majesty.

13:05.265 --> 13:06.185
Please

13:07.545 --> 13:09.145
grant your consent.

13:31.105 --> 13:33.185
-Hongqing.
-Yes.

13:33.265 --> 13:34.905
Take Luo Xianxue back to the palace.

13:35.505 --> 13:37.145
He'll bear witness to
the future empress's vow.

13:37.225 --> 13:38.225
Understood.

13:48.105 --> 13:49.025
Grand Tutor Ling,

13:50.105 --> 13:51.825
you truly played a fine move.

13:55.065 --> 13:56.225
You let Cangcang go

13:57.105 --> 13:59.865
and then used the lives
of your clan and Luo Xianxue

14:00.705 --> 14:03.985
to make her agree to marry me.

14:05.225 --> 14:06.865
You remain the kind father in her heart,

14:07.465 --> 14:11.345
while I have become the ruthless villain.

14:12.625 --> 14:14.425
Your skill truly surpasses mine.

14:17.825 --> 14:18.905
Your Majesty,

14:19.905 --> 14:21.585
you've gotten what you wished for.

14:24.945 --> 14:26.265
Are you not satisfied?

14:40.345 --> 14:43.265
TWO MONTHS LATER

14:44.465 --> 14:46.145
CHANGHE GATE

14:51.265 --> 14:52.265
By imperial decree,

14:52.345 --> 14:56.705
the daughter of Grand Tutor Ling,
Ling Cangcang, is hereby named Empress.

14:57.905 --> 15:01.185
The officials shall attend
the ceremony bearing their insignias.

15:06.585 --> 15:09.305
DU TINGXIN,
IMPERIAL PRECEPTOR OF GREAT QI

15:09.385 --> 15:11.545
Madam,
His Majesty's wedding is about to begin.

15:11.625 --> 15:12.465
Please come down and change.

15:16.345 --> 15:18.225
The refinement of
the pill is at a critical stage.

15:19.545 --> 15:20.945
I cannot afford distraction.

15:27.985 --> 15:29.465
Such worldly affairs

15:31.585 --> 15:32.705
need not concern me.

15:34.185 --> 15:35.105
Understood.

15:39.505 --> 15:41.305
THE CAPITAL

15:43.545 --> 15:44.985
By decree,

15:45.065 --> 15:48.105
I come at this auspicious
hour to escort Her Majesty.

15:49.385 --> 15:51.505
I follow the rites as commanded.

15:57.625 --> 15:58.785
The auspicious hour is upon us.

15:58.865 --> 16:00.585
Please don your coronet and bridal robes.

17:10.224 --> 17:11.424
That snowy night,

17:12.025 --> 17:13.985
who was it that said
she would willingly marry me?

17:15.105 --> 17:16.265
What is it?

17:16.345 --> 17:18.184
Have you changed your mind?

17:19.704 --> 17:21.184
How could I

17:23.065 --> 17:24.944
willingly marry a murderer?

17:29.465 --> 17:30.985
Don't you want

17:31.065 --> 17:32.665
to enter the palace and
see your adoptive brother?

17:33.745 --> 17:35.385
I've had Li Hongqing look after him.

17:35.465 --> 17:36.505
I wonder

17:37.105 --> 17:38.745
if he's grown used to life in the palace.

17:54.305 --> 17:56.425
Heed His Majesty!

17:56.505 --> 17:57.385
I believe

17:57.465 --> 17:59.465
the way of governance should
follow the order of Heaven and Earth,

17:59.545 --> 18:02.145
and harmony within
the household is the root of all virtue.

18:02.225 --> 18:03.905
To teach and to
guide both family and state,

18:03.985 --> 18:06.545
a woman's virtue is
the foundation of royal morality.

18:06.625 --> 18:09.105
Through such virtue,
the world may share one code of ethics,

18:09.185 --> 18:11.105
and all hearts may
turn toward righteousness.

18:11.185 --> 18:13.625
Thus, together we may honor our ancestors

18:13.705 --> 18:15.185
and uphold filial
piety throughout the realm.

18:15.265 --> 18:16.905
Ling,

18:16.985 --> 18:19.825
the daughter of Grand Tutor Ling Xuefeng,

18:19.905 --> 18:21.265
was born into a noble house

18:21.345 --> 18:22.985
of enduring virtue and good fortune.

18:23.065 --> 18:25.065
May the Empress and I

18:25.145 --> 18:26.625
strive in diligence and respect,

18:26.705 --> 18:28.305
cultivate virtue,

18:28.385 --> 18:30.865
and carry forward
the grace of our forebears.

18:30.945 --> 18:32.225
May enlightenment and harmony spread,

18:32.305 --> 18:34.425
bringing everlasting blessings

18:34.505 --> 18:37.265
to our descendants and our people.

18:37.345 --> 18:39.025
Let this be proclaimed

18:39.105 --> 18:41.425
to all under Heaven.

18:44.545 --> 18:45.465
The ceremony is complete.

18:46.225 --> 18:47.265
Please, Your Majesty, keep your word

18:48.385 --> 18:49.705
and release Luo Xianxue.

18:49.785 --> 18:51.505
We haven't drunk the nuptial wine yet.

18:52.625 --> 18:53.585
Once we do,

18:55.025 --> 18:55.985
you'll let him go.

19:24.385 --> 19:25.265
The wine is finished.

19:26.065 --> 19:26.985
Please honor your promise, Your Majesty.

19:27.745 --> 19:28.665
From this day on,

19:29.185 --> 19:30.665
you are my empress.

19:34.385 --> 19:35.465
Go and change.

19:51.905 --> 19:52.745
Get out.

19:57.305 --> 19:58.905
You are my empress.

19:58.985 --> 19:59.945
Why should I leave?

20:00.545 --> 20:02.305
You promised me you'd set him free.

20:04.265 --> 20:06.305
-Leave us.
-Yes, Your Majesty.

20:10.745 --> 20:13.545
On this joyous day,

20:14.585 --> 20:17.145
is Luo Xianxue all you can think about?

20:17.865 --> 20:19.985
Between you and me,
is there truly any joy to speak of?

20:21.945 --> 20:23.225
Do you love him?

20:30.705 --> 20:31.865
My empress,

20:31.945 --> 20:34.025
who married me of her own accord,

20:34.705 --> 20:35.745
did so out of love for Luo Xianxue?

20:36.865 --> 20:39.585
Is that why you
tried to run away with him?

20:56.425 --> 20:57.825
Answer me.

21:14.705 --> 21:17.105
Cangcang, I truly love you.

21:17.825 --> 21:18.745
Marry me.

21:27.985 --> 21:28.825
Yes, I love him.

21:29.585 --> 21:30.785
If I could choose,

21:31.465 --> 21:33.345
I'd flee this cursed city with him.

21:34.505 --> 21:35.345
Are you satisfied now?

21:36.145 --> 21:38.105
Do you know what you just said

21:38.185 --> 21:39.385
is enough to have him
executed ten thousand times?

21:40.025 --> 21:41.905
If he dies, I won't live either.

21:46.945 --> 21:49.145
Threatening me with death?

21:49.225 --> 21:50.825
That only works if I care about you.

21:51.745 --> 21:54.065
Do you really think I do?

22:16.905 --> 22:19.705
You are destined
to become Empress someday.

22:19.785 --> 22:21.905
I don't care for that title.

22:22.665 --> 22:25.665
I just want to win someone's heart
and roam the world with my sword.

22:28.265 --> 22:29.545
Find a chance to leave first.

22:30.145 --> 22:31.665
I will make sure you are unharmed.

22:31.745 --> 22:33.065
If you dare take your own life,

22:33.985 --> 22:36.225
the entire Ling clan
will follow you to the grave.

22:59.985 --> 23:00.985
Who are you?

23:04.425 --> 23:06.025
Are you Ling Cangcang

23:13.385 --> 23:15.145
or the Empress of Great Qi?

23:17.545 --> 23:19.385
Do you love the Emperor?

23:31.545 --> 23:33.105
Or do you love

23:36.385 --> 23:37.585
Bai Chifan?

23:45.625 --> 23:46.705
Bai Chifan…

23:52.545 --> 23:54.145
Why did you lie to me?

23:57.465 --> 23:59.185
He does not exist.

23:59.905 --> 24:00.865
Bai Chifan…

24:04.265 --> 24:07.705
Bai Chifan never existed.

24:13.185 --> 24:14.585
Bai Chifan…

24:47.265 --> 24:49.225
You slept well last night, my empress.

24:49.305 --> 24:50.745
What do you want?

24:51.425 --> 24:52.825
Why so hostile toward me?

24:53.425 --> 24:57.345
I came first thing this morning
with a gift for you.

24:57.985 --> 24:58.945
What gift?

24:59.025 --> 25:01.225
Your adoptive brother, Luo Xianxue,

25:01.305 --> 25:03.265
was returned
to the Ling Manor this morning.

25:08.625 --> 25:09.825
Really?

25:10.785 --> 25:11.625
A ruler does not jest.

25:17.985 --> 25:19.025
Thank you, Your Majesty.

25:27.545 --> 25:29.745
I kept something of Luo's

25:29.825 --> 25:30.945
as a present for you.

25:57.985 --> 26:01.465
Xiaoshan, pick up the gift I brought.

26:01.545 --> 26:02.705
Keep it safe for the Empress.

26:03.745 --> 26:04.705
Yes, Your Majesty.

26:13.665 --> 26:14.825
What are you trying to do?

26:20.145 --> 26:23.865
My gift is to remind you:

26:24.385 --> 26:26.225
there are things you must not do

26:27.065 --> 26:29.705
and rules you must obey.

26:30.665 --> 26:32.665
Break them, and you will pay the price.

26:44.345 --> 26:47.345
This pear blossom hairpin
is the one I gave you, isn't it?

26:49.225 --> 26:50.305
If I recall correctly,

26:51.025 --> 26:53.305
you wore this very hairpin

26:53.385 --> 26:54.745
the day you tried to
run off with Luo Xianxue.

26:58.745 --> 26:59.905
It was picked at random.

27:01.665 --> 27:03.905
The more casual the choice,
the truer the feeling behind it.

27:16.825 --> 27:17.825
Remember,

27:19.345 --> 27:20.865
you are my empress.

27:22.185 --> 27:24.185
As long as you fulfill
your duties as Empress,

27:24.745 --> 27:27.585
nothing like today will ever happen again.

27:49.025 --> 27:49.865
ONE YEAR AGO

27:49.945 --> 27:50.905
I've heard

27:50.985 --> 27:53.145
young boys have been
going missing in Southern Chu.

27:53.225 --> 27:54.705
More than 100 have vanished so far.

27:54.785 --> 27:56.425
Has anyone reported this?

27:58.705 --> 28:00.105
Your Majesty,

28:00.185 --> 28:01.705
Southern Chu has always
been peaceful and prosperous,

28:01.785 --> 28:02.865
and it is governed by
the Prince of Yuzhang.

28:02.945 --> 28:05.345
How could that happen?
Perhaps Your Majesty was misinformed.

28:05.425 --> 28:07.545
Insolence! Though His Majesty
ascended the throne young,

28:07.625 --> 28:08.545
he is both virtuous and wise.

28:08.625 --> 28:10.625
How dare you speak so presumptuously?

28:10.705 --> 28:13.105
The Prince of Yuzhang has
always ruled Southern Chu with diligence.

28:13.185 --> 28:15.185
We must not
dishearten such a loyal official.

28:15.265 --> 28:17.105
His Majesty is still young
and hasn't governed personally…

28:17.185 --> 28:19.065
-Mr. Liu, you are mistaken.
-…It's you schemers…

28:19.145 --> 28:21.105
-The news has already reached His Majesty.
-…who wish to frame the Prince of Yuzhang…

28:21.185 --> 28:22.825
-How could it be false?
-…In that case,

28:22.905 --> 28:24.385
let the Prince of
Yuzhang investigate by himself.

28:24.465 --> 28:26.745
-Why trouble His Majesty?
-What a ridiculous notion!

28:26.825 --> 28:27.985
Enough.

28:32.225 --> 28:34.785
This matter
concerns the peace of an entire region

28:35.625 --> 28:36.985
and is of great importance.

28:37.065 --> 28:39.625
To prevent ill-intentioned
men from exploiting it,

28:40.305 --> 28:41.265
we must

28:42.105 --> 28:44.145
proceed with utmost caution.

28:48.785 --> 28:50.385
Those court officials kept chattering,

28:50.465 --> 28:51.705
saying either that Your Majesty is frail,

28:51.785 --> 28:52.745
or that you have never ruled in person.

28:52.825 --> 28:53.465
TRANQUIL CLARITY

28:53.545 --> 28:54.625
They don't take
Your Majesty seriously at all.

28:54.705 --> 28:56.225
Grand Tutor Ling promised

28:56.305 --> 28:58.505
to hand over the reins of power after you
married Miss Ling,

28:58.585 --> 29:00.825
yet now he keeps delaying,
refusing to yield.

29:01.425 --> 29:03.745
In court today,
he even defended the Prince of Yuzhang.

29:03.825 --> 29:05.705
Could he mean to break off the engagement?

29:11.985 --> 29:14.265
The Grand Tutor holds great power.
He won't give it up easily.

29:14.345 --> 29:16.745
If I keep backing down,
I'll remain under his control.

29:16.825 --> 29:18.785
There are spies everywhere in the palace.

29:18.865 --> 29:21.545
Perhaps it's time to find someone
who can break the stalemate.

29:28.385 --> 29:30.345
Hongqing, where is Ling Cangcang?

29:35.185 --> 29:36.225
Southern Chu?

29:38.345 --> 29:40.145
SOUTHERN CHU

29:40.225 --> 29:40.865
RECRUITING TALENTS

29:40.945 --> 29:42.545
-Shall we give it a try?
-Let's go.

29:42.625 --> 29:43.345
Everyone,

29:43.425 --> 29:44.025
FENGLAI PAVILION

29:44.105 --> 29:46.225
Fenglai Pavilion
offers a heavy reward today

29:46.305 --> 29:47.145
to seek a new hall master.

29:47.225 --> 29:49.825
Whoever can defeat Hall Master Luo

29:49.905 --> 29:52.385
will be hired immediately.
The pay is ten liang a month.

29:52.465 --> 29:54.745
-Ten liang?
-Ten liang for real?

29:55.825 --> 29:59.225
Why would Grand Tutor Ling
allow his only daughter

29:59.305 --> 30:00.865
to linger in a place like this?

30:01.465 --> 30:03.425
Isn't he afraid a stray blade

30:04.025 --> 30:05.945
-might harm his precious girl?
-You go!

30:06.025 --> 30:08.865
I heard Ling Cangcang defied her father
and ran away from home.

30:08.945 --> 30:10.225
According to Shi Yan,

30:10.305 --> 30:11.945
the man over there, Luo Xianxue,

30:12.745 --> 30:14.385
is known as Southern Chu's Top Swordsman.

30:16.945 --> 30:18.345
Yes!

30:25.185 --> 30:27.745
As for that woman, her name is Zhong Lin.

30:27.825 --> 30:28.825
She's a skilled fighter as well.

30:36.145 --> 30:37.425
With those two around,

30:37.505 --> 30:39.665
I doubt Ling Cangcang is in any danger.

30:49.185 --> 30:52.265
-Wonderful!
-Amazing!

30:55.545 --> 30:56.985
It seems she and her father

30:57.665 --> 30:58.985
aren't quite the same.

31:02.065 --> 31:05.265
An hour has passed.
Does anyone else dare to challenge?

31:05.945 --> 31:07.545
No one's stepped up for a while.

31:07.625 --> 31:09.185
What's going on?

31:09.265 --> 31:10.345
No challengers at all?

31:13.305 --> 31:14.825
If no one comes forward,

31:14.905 --> 31:16.065
-then we'll…
-Wait!

31:17.105 --> 31:18.145
-Go!
-He's going up!

31:18.225 --> 31:19.585
-Let him on!
-Hurry!

31:19.665 --> 31:21.105
Over here! Someone's going up!

31:21.185 --> 31:27.025
-Go!
-Go!

31:27.105 --> 31:28.305
-Hurry!
-Go!

31:28.385 --> 31:29.825
-Go!
-Go!

31:29.905 --> 31:36.785
-Yes!
-Yes!

31:54.945 --> 31:56.305
Wait!

32:02.065 --> 32:02.905
EXEMPLARY VIRTUE

32:02.985 --> 32:04.625
He looked like the Prince of Yuzhang.

32:04.705 --> 32:06.185
He wouldn't draw
suspicion disguised as the Prince.

32:06.705 --> 32:08.625
Why not let him compete?

32:08.705 --> 32:09.985
He didn't come with good intentions.

32:10.585 --> 32:11.425
We mustn't use him.

32:12.065 --> 32:13.185
What is this, Miss Ling?

32:13.265 --> 32:14.785
Are you going back on your word?

32:15.465 --> 32:16.465
I knew it.

32:16.545 --> 32:17.905
He was calm and composed,

32:17.985 --> 32:19.425
certainly no ordinary fighter.

32:19.945 --> 32:21.465
His stance was steady,

32:21.545 --> 32:23.145
yet his hands bore no calluses.

32:23.225 --> 32:24.625
He was clearly trained by a master

32:24.705 --> 32:25.825
but lacked real combat experience.

32:26.785 --> 32:28.665
And that upright bearing,

32:28.745 --> 32:29.705
that air of nobility…

32:29.785 --> 32:31.905
He must be

32:34.025 --> 32:36.625
a spy sent by my father.

32:38.985 --> 32:40.425
Who are you calling a spy?

32:41.225 --> 32:42.465
How did you get in here?

32:43.145 --> 32:44.905
The match was suddenly canceled.

32:45.705 --> 32:47.505
Even the guards are
busy explaining things.

32:50.145 --> 32:52.105
Uninvited guest, what brings you here?

32:52.185 --> 32:54.585
I sincerely wish to join Fenglai Pavilion.

32:58.025 --> 32:59.385
There's an expression that suits you well:

33:02.225 --> 33:03.985
-fine on the outside
-but rotten within.

33:06.705 --> 33:07.865
My sword hasn't even left its sheath.

33:07.945 --> 33:09.265
Why such harsh words, Miss Ling?

33:14.745 --> 33:16.145
I've always been one

33:16.225 --> 33:18.545
to see the whole
picture from a single clue.

33:18.625 --> 33:21.105
-Have you perhaps misunderstood me?
-My apologies.

33:21.185 --> 33:23.065
Guards, see him out.

33:25.185 --> 33:27.265
I've long admired Fenglai Pavilion.

33:27.345 --> 33:28.945
I truly wish to join.

33:30.785 --> 33:32.825
Fenglai Pavilion's
fame spreads far and wide.

33:32.905 --> 33:35.225
Many wish to join in earnest,

33:36.105 --> 33:37.145
but I can't possibly
accept everyone, can I?

33:38.745 --> 33:40.305
Luo, see him out.

33:40.385 --> 33:42.025
You made the rules,

33:42.105 --> 33:43.065
yet now you break your own word.

33:43.665 --> 33:46.745
I doubt this place will amount to much.

33:52.105 --> 33:54.585
The Emperor went to
Southern Chu under the pretext

33:55.185 --> 33:56.305
of convalescence?

33:57.465 --> 33:59.465
I underestimated him.

34:00.265 --> 34:03.545
Could it be
that he went after Ling Cangcang?

34:04.665 --> 34:05.545
What else could it be?

34:07.585 --> 34:10.784
Xiao Huan has truly grown bold.

34:10.865 --> 34:12.225
He wants to rule on his own.

34:14.105 --> 34:15.625
Send word to Qing.

34:15.705 --> 34:18.505
Tell him to win Ling Cangcang's heart

34:18.585 --> 34:19.425
while she's in Southern Chu.

34:22.065 --> 34:24.985
The Ninth Prince is brilliant
in both strategy and battle…

34:27.264 --> 34:29.744
Your Highness, these are the most
popular designs at present.

34:30.264 --> 34:32.025
…But he never bows to anyone.

34:32.105 --> 34:35.744
Asking him to fawn
over a spoiled, willful girl

34:35.824 --> 34:38.185
might be difficult.

34:38.744 --> 34:40.225
In my humble opinion,

34:40.865 --> 34:41.985
it would be better

34:42.065 --> 34:45.065
to make sure the Emperor
never returns from this trip.

34:46.185 --> 34:47.264
Of course I choose the peacock.

34:48.025 --> 34:49.025
I'm getting this tattoo

34:49.105 --> 34:50.705
only so the young
ladies will stay away from me.

34:50.784 --> 34:52.744
That way, I'll have an excuse
when Mother presses me to marry.

34:53.385 --> 34:54.744
You fool,

34:54.824 --> 34:57.065
do you want me to tattoo
a dragon and tiger in combat

34:57.825 --> 35:01.865
so the whole world thinks
I'm challenging the Emperor?

35:02.865 --> 35:04.225
My apologies. I wouldn't dare.

35:04.865 --> 35:06.625
Forget it. As for Ling Cangcang,

35:06.705 --> 35:08.185
as long as she stays out of my sight,

35:08.265 --> 35:10.105
I'll pretend I never saw her.

35:10.185 --> 35:11.225
SPLENDID TAILOR SHOP

35:11.305 --> 35:12.825
SPLENDID FINERY

35:12.905 --> 35:13.825
Welcome.

35:15.665 --> 35:17.625
This won't do. It's too plain.

35:17.705 --> 35:18.665
Do you have something more elegant?

35:18.745 --> 35:19.785
You could have it custom-made,

35:19.865 --> 35:22.185
but it would take about a month.

35:24.345 --> 35:26.505
Miss Ling,
we still haven't found a hall master.

35:26.585 --> 35:27.585
How can we carry out the plan?

35:27.665 --> 35:29.425
I already have someone in mind.

35:29.505 --> 35:30.465
For now, the priority

35:30.545 --> 35:32.225
is to get our hands on
the Prince of Yuzhang's clothes.

35:34.265 --> 35:36.785
Do you have anything ready-made?
We need it urgently.

35:36.865 --> 35:39.025
To tell the truth, Miss Ling, a while ago,

35:39.105 --> 35:40.545
a servant from
the Prince of Yuzhang's Manor

35:40.625 --> 35:42.585
ordered a casual outfit for the Prince,

35:42.665 --> 35:45.065
but for some reason,
they never came to collect it.

35:45.145 --> 35:47.585
In that case, let us take that one.

35:47.665 --> 35:48.905
Well, I can't…

35:50.625 --> 35:52.345
I suppose I can do that.

35:53.145 --> 35:54.745
All right, I'll do as you say.

35:55.985 --> 35:57.145
Much obliged.

35:59.465 --> 36:01.105
I've never worn anything like this.

36:01.185 --> 36:03.985
Perhaps
someone else should try it on instead.

36:06.905 --> 36:09.385
Luo,
you're not just here to try on clothes.

36:09.465 --> 36:10.745
I'm

36:11.665 --> 36:13.425
counting on you for the task.

36:15.425 --> 36:18.505
Sir, that outfit was made for the Prince!

36:19.665 --> 36:20.505
The outfit

36:21.505 --> 36:22.345
for the Prince?

36:26.345 --> 36:27.745
Wait! Please wait!

36:27.825 --> 36:29.425
That outfit was
custom-made for the Prince.

36:29.505 --> 36:30.905
How could you just put it on and leave?

36:32.985 --> 36:34.585
I like it.

36:34.665 --> 36:35.985
It suits me quite well.

36:37.505 --> 36:38.905
I'll pay handsomely for it.

36:45.025 --> 36:46.385
Well, in that case…

36:47.305 --> 36:49.585
What are you after, really?
Why are you following us?

36:54.385 --> 36:55.625
You again?

36:57.105 --> 36:59.825
Sorry, but we bought that outfit.

37:00.545 --> 37:01.665
You'll have to take it off.

37:04.585 --> 37:05.505
Wait!

37:42.305 --> 37:43.705
Don't ruin the outfit!

37:43.785 --> 37:45.745
That's Shu brocade!

37:45.825 --> 37:47.705
Miss Ling, please stop them!

37:51.425 --> 37:53.185
You want this outfit that badly?

37:54.305 --> 37:55.385
Listen,

37:55.465 --> 37:58.105
if you let me join Fenglai Pavilion,
I'll give it to you.

38:05.465 --> 38:07.385
Luo, forget it.

38:08.305 --> 38:09.985
There's more than one
tailor shop in Southern Chu.

38:11.625 --> 38:12.465
Let's go.

38:16.185 --> 38:17.785
Do you really hate
the idea of me joining that much?

38:18.865 --> 38:21.665
Then tell me,
why are you so eager to join?

38:22.665 --> 38:24.345
I was born defiant.
I never accept defeat easily.

38:24.425 --> 38:26.305
What a coincidence. Neither do I.

38:42.865 --> 38:44.545
What exactly is Ling Cangcang after?

38:44.625 --> 38:46.025
Have you found anything?

38:46.105 --> 38:47.625
She's always with Luo Xianxue,

38:48.465 --> 38:51.025
but Zhong Lin's been
going outside the city often.

38:51.105 --> 38:51.945
Where exactly?

38:52.785 --> 38:54.785
-Near the Southern Chu mine.
-The mine?

38:55.585 --> 38:58.225
So she's after more than just clothes.

38:58.825 --> 38:59.865
Shi Yan,

38:59.945 --> 39:01.945
I want to know everything about that mine.

39:02.985 --> 39:03.825
Understood.

39:05.345 --> 39:06.265
Ling Cangcang,

39:06.905 --> 39:08.705
why did you cast aside the Empress's seat?

39:09.345 --> 39:10.825
What is it that you truly want?

39:27.985 --> 39:28.865
Master.

39:31.425 --> 39:32.345
Pear blossom honey?

39:32.425 --> 39:34.465
I knew it.

39:34.545 --> 39:36.905
No one understands me better than you.

39:39.825 --> 39:41.905
Master, let me pour you some tea.

39:43.385 --> 39:44.345
Here.

39:44.425 --> 39:46.785
You haven't visited me at
the Sword Cottage for a long time.

39:46.865 --> 39:48.785
What have you been up to?

39:49.825 --> 39:51.585
Nothing escapes you, Master.

39:51.665 --> 39:53.745
A mine has recently yielded iron ore,

39:54.465 --> 39:56.785
an extremely rare
metal for forging swords.

39:57.625 --> 39:58.865
Whoever obtains it

39:59.505 --> 40:00.625
will make their name
across the martial world.

40:00.705 --> 40:02.825
You still dream of
roaming the martial world?

40:02.905 --> 40:04.065
Don't forget, you are destined

40:04.745 --> 40:06.385
to become Empress someday.

40:08.425 --> 40:10.425
I don't care for that title.

40:11.225 --> 40:13.745
I just want to win someone's heart
and roam the world

40:14.665 --> 40:15.585
with my sword.

40:17.585 --> 40:18.425
Cangcang,

40:19.025 --> 40:21.705
there are few things in this world
that turn out as one wishes.

40:22.385 --> 40:24.825
May your joy at
least last a little longer.

40:26.145 --> 40:29.585
EXEMPLARY VIRTUE

40:29.665 --> 40:31.225
Cangcang, we've got the clothes.

40:39.905 --> 40:40.945
Turn around.

40:43.865 --> 40:47.385
Miss Ling, something feels off.

40:50.465 --> 40:52.545
It's missing a bit of
the Prince of Yuzhang's…

40:52.625 --> 40:53.665
Nobility!

40:54.785 --> 40:55.945
Exactly.

41:14.385 --> 41:15.425
Hands behind your back.

41:17.385 --> 41:18.225
Stand straighter.

41:19.625 --> 41:20.625
A little more.

41:21.905 --> 41:23.545
Yes, remember this posture.

41:24.305 --> 41:25.745
Now you look eighty percent like him.

41:28.825 --> 41:31.545
The Prince needs a tattoo artist.

41:31.625 --> 41:33.385
We can…

41:41.265 --> 41:42.825
Your Highness, they've arrived.

41:44.145 --> 41:45.545
Liubao says your skills are unmatched.

41:45.625 --> 41:47.665
You must tattoo

41:47.745 --> 41:50.305
the most magnificent
peacock in Great Qi for me.

41:50.385 --> 41:51.505
Yes, Your Highness.

41:52.105 --> 41:52.945
Begin.

42:01.625 --> 42:03.265
It might sting a little.

42:03.345 --> 42:05.905
Pain is nothing. Hurry up.

42:09.025 --> 42:10.225
Didn't you say you weren't afraid of pain?

42:11.985 --> 42:13.745
Shall I have my
assistant fetch a paperweight?

42:13.825 --> 42:16.025
You can squeeze it if it hurts.

42:16.105 --> 42:17.905
-Go. Hurry.
-Yes, Your Highness.

42:24.225 --> 42:25.705
A golden embroidered box?

42:25.785 --> 42:26.625
That must be it.

42:28.825 --> 42:30.425
Your Highness, here's the paperweight.

42:31.185 --> 42:32.185
Hold it firmly.

43:14.905 --> 43:17.545
After I dotted the eye,
the phoenix immediately came to life.

43:17.625 --> 43:20.145
Bear with it a little longer.
I'm almost finished.

43:20.225 --> 43:22.905
I asked for a peacock!

43:24.985 --> 43:26.665
When a peacock rests
upon the Azure Dragon's back,

43:26.745 --> 43:28.105
it takes on the grace of a phoenix.

43:28.185 --> 43:30.105
Your Highness's
nobility is truly overwhelming.

43:34.105 --> 43:36.105
I was momentarily distracted by awe.

43:36.185 --> 43:37.825
I'll put my utmost care into this.

43:37.905 --> 43:38.745
Let's continue.

43:48.025 --> 43:49.745
Your Highness, the peacock is complete.

43:51.145 --> 43:52.185
Complete?

43:53.345 --> 43:55.465
-Already?
-Yes.

43:56.065 --> 43:58.065
It looks stunning on your back,

43:58.665 --> 43:59.825
almost alive.

44:06.665 --> 44:07.945
Truly.

44:09.105 --> 44:11.545
You two, bring me a bronze mirror.

44:11.625 --> 44:12.505
I want to see for myself.

44:13.625 --> 44:14.505
Sure. I'll fetch one.

44:15.625 --> 44:16.465
Hurry.

44:21.785 --> 44:22.905
The mold's ready.

44:22.985 --> 44:23.905
Can you really reproduce it?

44:23.985 --> 44:25.865
Trust me. I'm Zhong Lin.

44:25.945 --> 44:27.385
It'll be identical,
down to the finest detail.

44:27.465 --> 44:28.825
Miss!

44:28.905 --> 44:31.105
A mister bought these flowers for you.

44:32.545 --> 44:33.585
Who?

44:34.865 --> 44:35.985
Him again?
